    {
      "id": 1775792233071,
      "rule": "PREFER: fee capture as the primary quality signal in GENZ-SOL-type pools; the best-performing LPs in both studied GENZ pools showed roughly 19.7% to 32.5% feePercent, while weaker cohorts were mostly closer to about 7.4% to 18.5%, so prioritize setups that convert time in range into materially stronger fees.",
